i"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p017","text":"成公元年冬，楚莊王為夏徵舒殺靈公，率諸侯伐陳。謂陳曰：「無驚，吾誅徵舒而已。」已誅徵舒，因縣陳而有之，群臣畢賀。申叔時使於齊來還，獨不賀。莊王問其故，對曰：「鄙語有之，牽牛徑人田，田主奪之牛。徑則有罪矣，奪之牛，不亦甚乎？今王以徵舒為賊弒君，故徵兵諸侯，以義伐之，已而取之，以利其地，則後何以令於天下！是以不賀。」莊王曰：「善。」乃迎陳靈公太子午於晉而立之，復君陳如故，是為成公。孔子讀史記至楚復陳，曰：「賢哉楚莊王！輕千乘之國而重一言。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001490","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"夏徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"徵舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"申叔時","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001492","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m017-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"田主","kind":"unresolved","person_id"